    turnFlow: 'Each player receives five cards face down. Before the first bet, only a player with a pair of jacks or better (or a stronger hand) may open; others must pass. Once someone opens, remaining players may call, raise, or fold. After the first betting round, each active player may discard up to three cards and receive replacements. A second betting round follows, then showdown: the highest hand wins the pot. If the opener split openers (discarded part of the qualifying hand), those discards must be shown when the pot is awarded.',
